{"id":"a2a2a019192aaa2c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient.md","title":"依赖对PER的商集分解","display":"thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient — 依赖对PER的商集分解","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient","aliases":["72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient"],"display":"thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient — 依赖对PER的商集分解","depends_on":["[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]]","[[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X dependent pairs and PER membership print739–750/PDF751–762; local quotient theorem","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient — 依赖对PER的商集分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" href=\"?note=5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" title=\"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per\">72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a57a1e194dcbcdea\" href=\"?note=a57a1e194dcbcdea\" title=\"72-thm-dependent-pair-per\">72-thm-dependent-pair-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X dependent pairs and PER membership print739–750/PDF751–762; local quotient theorem"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" href=\"?note=5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" title=\"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per\">72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per</a> 的全部结构条件；PER 性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a57a1e194dcbcdea\" href=\"?note=a57a1e194dcbcdea\" title=\"72-thm-dependent-pair-per\">72-thm-dependent-pair-per</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\">\\(R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\)</span>；纤维满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;)\">\\(a\\alpha a&#39;\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a&#39;)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma\">\\(B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_\\Sigma:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_\\Sigma:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_\\Sigma:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B_\\Phi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_\\Sigma:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B_\\Phi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规范 pair 的相关性等价于第一分量 α 相关及第二分量在共同纤维中相关。纤维在 α 类上相同使目标的第二商类不随代表改变；单射 pair 与确定求值给反向识别。每个 R 类都包含一份规范 pair，每份目标数据又有这样的 pair，故图为双射。没有把依赖和误写为两个固定商集的笛卡尔积。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-dependent-pair-per","status":"resolved","id":"a57a1e194dcbcdea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}$ 取 [[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] 的全部结构条件；PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]]。$R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$；纤维满足 $a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')$。$B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma$ 在下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-dependent-pair-per","status":"resolved","id":"a57a1e194dcbcdea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}$ 取 [[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] 的全部结构条件；PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]]。$R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$；纤维满足 $a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')$。$B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\Phi:=\\{\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"q_\\Sigma:=\\{\\langle[\\operatorname{pair}(a,b)]_R,\\langle[a]_\\alpha,[b]_{\\Phi(a)}\\rangle\\rangle:\na\\in|\\alpha|,\\ b\\in|\\Phi(a)|\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"q_\\Sigma:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}B_\\Phi.","display":true}],"bytes":1810,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anch